.TH devin-migrate-workflows 1  "workflows " 
.SH NAME
devin\-migrate\-workflows \- Migrate workflow files into skills and remove the originals
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin migrate workflows\fR [\fB\-\-scope\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrate workflow files into skills and remove the originals
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-scope\fR \fI<SCOPE>\fR [default: all]
Which workflows to migrate: all (default), workspace, or global
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
all: Migrate both workspace and global workflows
.IP \(bu 2
workspace: Migrate only workspace\-level workflows
.IP \(bu 2
global: Migrate only global workflows from ~/.codeium/
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
